# Privacy Policy — Tickets CGHX

**Last updated:** August 18, 2026

This Privacy Policy explains how **Tickets CGHX** handles information when you use the bot on Discord.

## 1. Information We May Process

Depending on the features being used, Tickets CGHX may process information provided through Discord, including:

* Discord user IDs;
* Discord server IDs;
* Channel IDs;
* Message IDs;
* Usernames or display names;
* Ticket and server configuration information.

The bot only processes information reasonably necessary to provide its features.

## 2. How Information Is Used

Information may be used to:

* Create and manage support tickets;
* Execute commands requested by users;
* Store server and bot configuration;
* Provide and maintain bot functionality;
* Prevent abuse and unauthorized use;
* Troubleshoot errors and improve the bot.

## 3. Data Storage

Some information may be stored for as long as necessary to provide the bot's features.

We do not sell personal information to third parties.

## 4. Sharing of Information

We do not intentionally sell or share users' personal information with third parties for advertising or commercial purposes.

Information may be disclosed when required by law or when necessary to protect the security and operation of the bot.

## 5. Data Deletion

Users or server administrators may request deletion of stored information associated with their use of Tickets CGHX.

To request deletion, contact the developer or administrator of the bot.

## 6. Security

Reasonable measures are used to protect stored information from unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.

However, no online service can guarantee absolute security.

## 7. Changes to This Privacy Policy

This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time. The latest version will always be available on this page.

## 8. Contact

For questions, privacy requests, or data deletion requests, please contact the developer or administrator of Tickets CGHX.

By using Tickets CGHX, you acknowledge this Privacy Policy.
